of managing the day-to-day operations of the
company?

The interview with Schmidt was finally
arranged. Schmidt was the CEO of Novell
and former chief technology officer at Sun
Microsystems. Although he wasn’t looking for a
new job, he knew he would need one soon after
Novell completed a merger that was in the
